      "text": "3.Insofar as the compensation for the lands, the petitioners 1 to 5 shall make an appropriate application to the second respondent enclosing relevant documents, in support of their title and claim and the second respondent shall consider the said documents and the representation of the petitioners 1 to 5 and pass final orders on merits and in accordance with law.\nhttps://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis ( Uploaded on: 18/03/2025 06:24:25 pm )\n4.With the above directions, this Writ Petition is disposed of.",
